{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0127_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_05_synopsis", "source_sha256": "325da5ab9358181d42d2b0b5fb83737242f80ceac2511c1a5596e9c35c4b6e48", "ja": "『アイメガ』の本番が近付き、レッスンに余\n念がない響と翼。休憩中も言葉を重ね、翼は\n憧れの理由、響は負けたくない理由を語る。\nやってきたプロデューサーに、ふたりは声を\n合わせ、なんくるないさーと言うのだった。", "zh": "《アイメガ》的正式演出临近，响和翼一心投入练习。\n休息时两人也聊个不停，翼说起了憧憬的理由，响则说起了不想输的理由。\n制作人来到后，两人异口同声地说道：“总会有办法的啦——。”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0127_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_05_1000_p", "source_sha256": "0400c6098c0c963950912212ad77cd74c2aac01e32675697d6b8232e7dd63217", "ja": "（『アイメガ』本番が近付いてきた。\n響と翼は毎日、レッスンを頑張っているようだ）", "zh": "（『偶像大赛』正式演出的日子越来越近了。响和翼似乎每天都在努力练习）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0127_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_05_1001_p", "source_sha256": "71f79f86ecef5052128389d3ac0e4e04a01990f3b90bac1f7763bfa8f044d565", "ja": "（裏方も何かと忙しくなってきてて、ほとんど\n立ち合えていないけど……後で顔を出してみるか）", "zh": "（后台也渐渐忙了起来，几乎没能在场见证……不过，之后还是去露个面吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0127_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_05_1002_013hib", "source_sha256": "d53716f0d9320362f6cc535bf041f07fdb1c0aeb7acc149e8c9ab33fbcb0aa01", "ja": "ほら翼、今日のさんぴん茶だぞ～。", "zh": "看，翼，今天的茉莉花茶哦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0127_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_05_1003_016tsu", "source_sha256": "763c7d78dec0b8955415721f995d4401eca69487eba468ae7c6c6c9c8f69f5f4", "ja": "わ～い、ありがとうございまーす！\nこれ、サッパリしておいしいんですよね～♪", "zh": "哇～谢谢你～！\n这个清爽又好喝呢～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0127_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_05_1004_013hib", "source_sha256": "8c0cd697e7b9b3a6e711a0aad2abe05003ea11fa39014be08522ea57772f959a", "ja": "飲み終わったら、自主練の計画を立てよう！\nお互い弱いところを、重点的にやっていこうね！", "zh": "喝完之后，我们来制定自主练习的计划吧！互相针对自己的薄弱环节，好好加强练习吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0127_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_05_1005_016tsu", "source_sha256": "dfacc9bbc2d1e2a0c8bbee09f5e5e73e169cf8239ed76f6d4f70e2c6d7098ed6", "ja": "ええっ、終わりじゃなかったんですか！？\nもう今日はレッスン、いっぱい頑張ったのに……。", "zh": "诶！？原来还没结束吗！？\n明明今天的训练已经很努力了……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0127_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_05_1006_013hib", "source_sha256": "c00cc23ffb9ae9b2dd7811f25a7d756db16ff565b1e34518121c739dce7d3f47", "ja": "あ、翼、疲れちゃった？　もちろん、\n無理はしなくていいぞ。休憩も大事だし！", "zh": "啊，翼，你累了吗？当然，\n不用勉强自己。休息也很重要！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0127_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_05_1007_016tsu", "source_sha256": "a756dba18e3e9ef5018d19c7172bdd94d34cd3ebb518a65c68da1b2dbd30671c", "ja": "まだ平気ですけど～。響さんって、本当に頑張り屋さん\nですよね。どうして、そんなに頑張れるんですか？", "zh": "我还挺得住啦～。响小姐真的很努力呢。\n你是怎么做到能那么努力的呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0127_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_05_1008_013hib", "source_sha256": "cdb5433c1cb8214adf0002d2ed0d8a774b3db81500872fb1e3a74b2f59cdc5a8", "ja": "え？　自分、そんなに頑張り屋さんかな。\n翼だって、最近はちゃんと頑張ってるでしょ？", "zh": "诶？我真的有那么努力吗？  \n翼最近不也一直在认真努力嘛？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0127_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_05_1009_016tsu", "source_sha256": "086e1308017d6f27b86e86d3dd56cdf60b6fb22ac9effe8ae55787c803cf4b6f", "ja": "えへへ。なんかちょっと頑張れちゃってまーす♪\n……でも響さんは、わたしと全然違うな～って。", "zh": "嘿嘿。感觉最近稍微有点努力过头了呢～♪\n……不过，我觉得响小姐和我完全不一样呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0127_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_05_1010_016tsu", "source_sha256": "93d8553e5788acdd7bc8e5c321d9a10b9335c003550fc4430f3a139d0b83c990", "ja": "なんかね、頑張ってる時もキラキラして見えるの。\n見てるだけで、ドキドキしてくる気がする……。", "zh": "怎么说呢，努力的时候整个人都看起来闪闪发光的。\n感觉光是看着，心跳就会加速……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0127_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_05_1011_013hib", "source_sha256": "314895e8a41d227b2dd950e8279b4bf23a80c4275fe68106e7d2ec4cf89030a7", "ja": "つ、翼……。デュオだからって、そんなに自分を\n褒めなくていいんだぞ？　……えへ、えへへへ……。", "zh": "翼……。就算是双人组合，也不用这么夸自己吧？……嘿、嘿嘿嘿……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0127_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_05_1012_016tsu", "source_sha256": "816b477d924426436a08369eb2e4cccfb3c97e2fb97be367f1a3851835abb622", "ja": "だってホントだもん。\nねえ、どうして、響さん？　教えて教えて～。", "zh": "因为本来就是事实嘛。\n对了，为什么呀，响姐？告诉我嘛～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0127_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_05_1013_013hib", "source_sha256": "6928b828ad272d314b5bbaa84d1f2c4d75983704da599ef0792bb2d2341bdf83", "ja": "う～ん、どうしてって言われても……。\nやっぱり、負けたくないからかな？", "zh": "嗯～，就算你问我为什么……也许是因为我果然不想输吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0127_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_05_1014_016tsu", "source_sha256": "f75a914c617029177554d30d370afb887f566d14900877456157ad1b2c09c231", "ja": "トップアイドルになるためってこと？　う～ん……。\nでもそれって、結構みんな同じですよね？", "zh": "是为了成为顶尖偶像吗？嗯……  \n但这一点，大家不都差不多吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0127_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_05_1015_013hib", "source_sha256": "57e344db772b61dea5694657e5364791def1fe6f555df0310feef02ca901a8f5", "ja": "そうだよね……う～ん……。\nあ、そっか！　自分、わかった気がするぞ！", "zh": "就是这样吧……嗯……\n啊，对了！我好像明白了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0127_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_05_1016_013hib", "source_sha256": "6737645b5450bb18c99d37b63a9c73c8dfae47327f725533cb7f45de0a66ac6c", "ja": "うん、間違いない！　翼、やっぱり自分、\n負けたくないんだ。玲音と詩花もだけど、仲間にも！", "zh": "嗯，肯定没错！翼，我果然还是\n不想认输。玲音和诗花自不必说，也不想输给同伴！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0127_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_05_1017_013hib", "source_sha256": "ddd6dfa9b18a186c525177dce86eb51db1a01f5586b7b438cb898a9241463c69", "ja": "美希にも真にも、765プロのみんなに負けたくない。\nもちろん、翼にもね！", "zh": "我也不想输给美希、真、765制作公司的大家。当然，也不想输给翼！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0127_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_05_1018_016tsu", "source_sha256": "04f27959947f7d92163b153e70ada05355bf8e6bf200debb45fad1e1a1ad2b66", "ja": "えっ、わたしですか？？\nでもわたしは、響さんと仲良くしたいのに～！", "zh": "诶，是我吗？？\n可是我明明想和响姐好好相处嘛～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0127_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_05_1019_013hib", "source_sha256": "b370ddf33e30a90b1506791b06aeb1fe10c3e73c6dbbee0d4dce818c81114ce4", "ja": "じ、自分だって仲良くしたいぞ！？　ていうか、仲良く\nしてるよね？　自分達、仲良しでいいんだよね？", "zh": "我、我也想和你要好啊！？话说回来，我们关系很好吧？我们算是好朋友，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0127_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_05_1020_016tsu", "source_sha256": "e6e46301c3e7d0fc9c8e97b2c1363e654f49e8c78129e5a56f33ab290ed532fc", "ja": "う、うん……わたしはいいと思いますよ？", "zh": "嗯、嗯……我是觉得可以呀？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0127_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_05_1021_013hib", "source_sha256": "aab1a3a5d1def1e4b1789ac0b4a2d09bacfbfbb61719009d3f0f5754eaf9451d", "ja": "ふう。よかったぞ……。あ、だからね。", "zh": "呼。太好了……啊，所以说啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0127_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_05_1022_013hib", "source_sha256": "4cd87e55c0ee3bbc71a2e56f18e8f2ef7637dc6531835bbb31fadf5f003482ab", "ja": "自分、みんなとずっと仲良くしたいから、\n負けたくないんだ！　だって……", "zh": "因为我想一直和大家好好相处，\n所以不想输！因为……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0127_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_05_1023_013hib", "source_sha256": "e984d35b1fb15971a26b264edc15e97e902715722a191a919b26874558f5dbff", "ja": "負けちゃったら、ステージで堂々と並んで\n立てないでしょ？　自分、それはイヤなんだ！", "zh": "要是输了，就没法在舞台上堂堂正正地并肩站在一起了吧？我可不想那样！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0127_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_05_1024_016tsu", "source_sha256": "fc89377aabe80110c2af2e346f218622fed56511c041e6792657e6b26a920182", "ja": "響さん……。\nわあ、すごーい！　なんか響さん、カッコイイ～！", "zh": "响姐……\n哇，好厉害！感觉响姐好帅气～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0127_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_05_1025_013hib", "source_sha256": "f7ee1984cba8742f64b06eb1e4dd9dd755d1609f4fca09ecd029cbfa02e668bb", "ja": "つ、翼……。だから、そんなに褒めなくて\nいいんだってば……えへ、えへへ……。", "zh": "翼……所以说，不用夸得这么厉害啦……嘿嘿，嘿嘿嘿……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0127_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_05_1026_016tsu", "source_sha256": "f0958065e9f5e4fddedb9e32f9937eb55ad70dcd5854f8055a5bec655052331d", "ja": "じゃあ、わたしも響さんに仲良くしてもらえるように\n頑張ろうっと。負けませんからね、響さん♪", "zh": "那么，我也要努力和响小姐好好相处。不会输给你的哦，响小姐♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0127_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_05_1027_013hib", "source_sha256": "5e35298a107b4699f43d93dc983e2b5af1da1040ceae4d321c99b476cdd29315", "ja": "おっ！　カッコいいぞ、翼！\nやっぱりデュオはこうでなくっちゃね！", "zh": "哦！真帅啊，翼！\n双人组合就该是这样嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0127_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_05_1028_016tsu", "source_sha256": "7145a3013810714169a9a5344c31b651ddb5432f97592d58f238ff8e136252f8", "ja": "あ。「負けません！」って言ったら、美希先輩も\n仲良くしてくれるかも！　今度試してみようっと♪", "zh": "啊！如果我说“我不会输的！”，美希前辈说不定也会愿意和我好好相处！下次试试看吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0127_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_05_1029_013hib", "source_sha256": "9248d1fd01798edffb653aa09d3ce747edad3a0c39eb0984ce73ec866b2d66ec", "ja": "むっ！？　……あの、翼？\nちょっと確かめておきたいんだけど……。", "zh": "唔！？……那个，翼？\n我有件事想先跟你确认一下……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0127_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_05_1030_016tsu", "source_sha256": "4c92de525f5f4d3d61fc040cba4d7979f12692848218528723dbb76fa95998d8", "ja": "？　なんですか、響さん？", "zh": "？怎么了，响小姐？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0127_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_05_1031_013hib", "source_sha256": "4435129a3c5e788447f4c090edeeec56bb2d1897627333fda62e28751c06a5e4", "ja": "えっと……あのね。自分と美希と、どっちがその……\n仲良く……う……ぐ……うぐぐぐぐ～！", "zh": "那个……就是。我和美希，谁更……要好……呜……咕……呜呜呜呜～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0127_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_05_1032_013hib", "source_sha256": "02631af950069fa45b53073f325ec8f19425d0337ec78b54e4b387c70636f2c2", "ja": "うぎゃー！　やっぱり、なんでもない！\nなんでもないんだ～！！", "zh": "哇啊——！果然还是什么都没有！\n什么事都没有啦——！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0127_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_05_1033_016tsu", "source_sha256": "ab138a85a3bc149ab71396a811e311332b618cce259c0d1baf4ca28bb6ff4247", "ja": "……えへへ。どっちもですけど～。\nでも今は、響さんと仲良くしたいでーす♪", "zh": "……嘿嘿。虽然两个都想啦～。\n不过我现在，想和响小姐好好搞好关系～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0127_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_05_1034_013hib", "source_sha256": "2950b3870fbd6e708067eb07928fe87244e5f7a27e237bda8bad72ba6b5f0b43", "ja": "はっ！　ううっ、翼～！　なんていい子なんだ～！\nあとでサーターアンダーギー作ってあげるね～！", "zh": "啊！呜呜，翼——！你真是个好孩子啊——！\n待会儿做沙塔安达吉给你吃哦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0127_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_05_1035_016tsu", "source_sha256": "5f8563feab3731bf72f855271bd0b51f58f266dacb318d97d6bb4aa016cac0cf", "ja": "わーい、やったぁ！\n楽しみにしてますね、響さん♪", "zh": "哇—，太好啦！\n我很期待哦，响前辈♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0127_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_05_1036_se", "source_sha256": "d7f0742f486712cf4a0ae941f2940c5ff5b706f1e8901b366c57f247e3b3cc81", "ja": "ガチャッ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0127_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_05_1037_p", "source_sha256": "f22c6a2030ef64dce0e25d491c68fadb888d98714bd8eb0e40cd0bc92644beb3", "ja": "響、翼、お疲れさま。もうレッスンは終わってたのか。\n何かにぎやかだったけど、何の話をしてたんだ？", "zh": "响、翼，辛苦了。已经结束练习了吗？\n刚才好像挺热闹的，你们在聊什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0127_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_05_1038_016tsu", "source_sha256": "62cd6fee35cb15c1c86dafcec5ff977d10fbff4f8f106327cfba47d429e0a81d", "ja": "響さんに、おやつを作ってもらうお話でーす♪", "zh": "我们在聊让响姐做点心的事～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0127_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_05_1039_013hib", "source_sha256": "9814c2d59583774d39e0946d8b3af70fbfc6ad196963dfd2fa7d565d71483743", "ja": "あまったら{$P$}にもあげるぞ。\nあ、翼がいいって言ったらね！", "zh": "要是有剩下的，也会给{$P$}。\n啊，得先问过翼同意才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0127_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_05_1040_p", "source_sha256": "b7301278e29f90c0bbfcb30ce578e3809e55c593be5b33ba5e7cf447146e5eb5", "ja": "そ、そうか、ありがとう……。それにしても、\n気のせいか急に、すごく仲良くなってないか？", "zh": "是、是吗，谢谢……不过话说回来，\n是不是我的错觉？我们突然变得特别要好了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0127_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_05_1041_016tsu", "source_sha256": "8341ed0180d9534b5e3141c4522bd0330e8d2734c79a08709943d7abd1543bc1", "ja": "だって響さん、カッコイイんだもん！", "zh": "因为响姐很帅嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0127_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_05_1042_013hib", "source_sha256": "1bdb50977a77d152a1b5b201ed4c10067e2da7db2efaa1d66fb75e608a082391", "ja": "だって翼、すっごくいい子だからね！", "zh": "因为翼是个特别好的孩子嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0127_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_05_1043_013hib", "source_sha256": "3904fee5ff603c4abd5c3f190e8a4968b8c21ec28ab58f58aaccadec9e199c62", "ja": "……えへへへへっ♪", "zh": "……嘿嘿嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0127_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_05_1044_016tsu", "source_sha256": "3904fee5ff603c4abd5c3f190e8a4968b8c21ec28ab58f58aaccadec9e199c62", "ja": "……えへへへへっ♪", "zh": "……嘿嘿嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0127_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_05_1045_p", "source_sha256": "6dbae55df36f401ff59f76635d36df3a4aee5562a8362c6dd068021f6e2b324f", "ja": "そ、そうか……よし、経緯はともかく状況は分かった。\nつまり、二人とも……デュオとして最高の状態だな？", "zh": "是、是这样啊……好吧，暂且不论来龙去脉，情况我明白了。也就是说，你们两个……作为二人组合，正处于最佳状态吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0127_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_05_1046_013hib", "source_sha256": "624dddce4776833af2165c4944ab7587392acf2b23890e4488d9013c46d80d80", "ja": "うんっ！　もう大丈夫だぞ、{$P$}！\n『アイメガ』のステージは、自分達に任せておけば……", "zh": "嗯！已经没问题了，{$P$}！\n“爱巨星”的舞台，只要交给我们……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0127_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_05_1047_013hib", "source_sha256": "6cca7cb78377212ea34ba75140d5aef1f5deebd2fadde98bcdcf60ac1cef3bb2", "ja": "なんくるないさー！", "zh": "总会有办法的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0127_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_05_1048_016tsu", "source_sha256": "b97518f822b06953365b46aca35e945976a7409d649882c5a4053bbb1cc6d374", "ja": "なんくるないさ～！", "zh": "总会有办法的啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0127_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_05_1049_p", "source_sha256": "8f2eaf60a883306b2120d1ecaa65a90e27e5e029badb4774dc35a2f54f57965d", "ja": "（返答もピッタリ。どうも本当に最高の状態らしい。\n『アイメガ』では、全員で堂々と胸を張れそうだな！）", "zh": "（回答也恰到好处。看来她是真的处于最佳状态。\n在《アイメガ》里，应该能和大家一起堂堂正正地挺起胸膛了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
